### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Israel Israeli",
    "phone": "050-1234567",
    "address": "Be'er Ya'akov",
    "password": "mySecretPassword"
}

###

### Register user with missing fields
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Israel Israeli"
}

###

### Register user with empty fields
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "phone": "",
    "address": "",
    "password": ""
}

###

### Get existing user by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_ID

###

### Get non-existing user
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/999999

###